@startuml
title RuleSphere - System Context Class Diagram\nOMG UML 2.5.1 System Context Model (F-01)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EAF6F8
skinparam classBorderColor #177E8D
skinparam ArrowColor #527183
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

' System under design
class "RuleSphere" as System <<software system>> {
  +evaluateDecision(request: EvaluationRequest): EvaluationResponse
  +authorDecision(draft: DecisionDraft): DraftResult
  +validateContracts(version: VersionId): ValidationReport
  +governRelease(candidate: ReleaseCandidate): GovernanceStatus
  +deployRollout(policy: RolloutPolicy): DeploymentStatus
  +queryTraceAndAudit(filter: AuditFilter): AuditRecords
}

' External Human Actors
class "A01: Decision Author" as A01 <<external, human>> {
  +authors decision graphs
  +defines schema contracts
  +executes sandbox simulations
}

class "A02: Workspace Owner" as A02 <<external, human>> {
  +manages workspace members
  +approves Tier 2 governance reviews
}

class "A03: Enterprise Admin" as A03 <<external, human>> {
  +provisions tenants & workspaces
  +issues/revokes API credentials
  +manages shared library assets
}

class "A04: Release Manager" as A04 <<external, human>> {
  +submits release candidates
  +configures shadow & canary rollouts
  +triggers promote and rollback
}

class "A05: Compliance Officer" as A05 <<external, human>> {
  +reviews Tier 3 high-risk decisions
  +inspects compliance ledger records
}

class "A06: Security Auditor" as A06 <<external, human>> {
  +inspects immutable audit logs
  +reviews tenant boundary isolation
}

class "A07: Application Developer" as A07 <<external, human>> {
  +discovers REST / gRPC API contracts
  +integrates consumer applications
}

' External System Actor
class "A08: Consumer Application" as A08 <<external, system>> {
  +submits runtime evaluation requests
  +sends version pinning headers
  +consumes evaluation outcomes
}

' System Boundaries & Associations with Multiplicity and Interactions
A01 "1..*" -- "1" System : interacts via Web UI / Management API\n(model, test, validate) >
A02 "1..*" -- "1" System : interacts via Management API\n(workspace config, peer review) >
A03 "1..*" -- "1" System : interacts via Management API\n(tenant admin, credentials, libraries) >
A04 "1..*" -- "1" System : interacts via Management API\n(release, shadow/canary, rollback) >
A05 "1..*" -- "1" System : interacts via Compliance Portal / API\n(Tier 3 approval, audit export) >
A06 "1..*" -- "1" System : interacts via Audit API\n(compliance and security logs) >
A07 "1..*" -- "1" System : interacts via Developer Portal\n(schema & contract discovery) >
A08 "1..*" -- "1" System : invokes via REST/HTTPS & gRPC/HTTP2\n(sub-10ms decision evaluation) >

note bottom of System
  **OMG UML 2.5.1 Context Semantics:**
  - RuleSphere is the software system at the core.
  - External human actors (A01-A07) interact through Control Plane interfaces.
  - External system actors (A08) execute high-throughput evaluations through Data Plane.
  - Replaces Yourdon-DeMarco DFD context diagram with formal UML 2.5.1 context class model.
end note

legend bottom
  <<software system>>: System under specification
  <<external, human>>: Human user roles
  <<external, system>>: External software client
  All associations define multiplicity and interaction intent.
endlegend
@enduml
